docs {
  # List ASH Feedback Submissions
  
  Returns a paginated list of ASH programme feedback submissions. Results can be paginated via `page` and `limit` query parameters.
  
  ## Authorization
  Requires `read` permission.
  
  ## Query Parameters
  
  | Parameter | Type   | Required | Default | Description                                    |
  |-----------|--------|----------|---------|------------------------------------------------|
  | page      | number | No       | `1`     | Page number (integer ≥ 1)                      |
  | limit     | number | No       | `25`    | Items per page (integer, 1–100)                |
  
  ## Response
  
  **`200 OK`** — Returns a paginated array of ASH feedback records.
  
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": [ ... ],
    "meta": {
      "pagination": {
        "page": 1,
        "limit": 25,
        "totalPages": 1
      }
    }
  }
  ```
  
  ## Errors
  
  | Status                      | Description                                         |
  |-----------------------------|-----------------------------------------------------|
  | `400 Bad Request`           | Invalid query parameters (e.g. non-numeric `page`). |
  | `500 Internal Server Error` | Unexpected server error.                            |
}
